// Package services contains the business logic workflows for domain entities.
//
// Responsibilities:
//  1. Enforce business rules and domain invariants (e.g. uniqueness).
//  2. Orchestrate calls across one or more repositories.
//  3. Propagate context.Context to all I/O operations for cancellation and timeouts.
//  4. Emit structured log entries using slog.
//  5. Remain completely agnostic of transport layer details (no HTTP structs or status codes).
//
// Primary keys: int/bigint ids are assigned by the database; uuid ids are generated
// with newUUID (ids_gen.go, regenerated by goforge).
package services
